<http://data.silknow.org/object/55ccea87-de0b-3a46-89a0-0848d0048b0e/observation/1>
        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/technical-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Dress panel of embroidered silk. With two green stripes in the selvedge and embroidered with coloured silks in long and short, satin and chain stitches and French knots. Small sprigs of flowers and fruit at intervals, including prunus blossom, carnation, tulip and pomegranate. Colours in blue, pink, yellow, green, brown and black. The panel is made up of two triangular pieces of silk once sewn and tacked together. Three small pieces have been added at the narrow end."@en ;
        crmsci:O8_observed  <http://data.silknow.org/object/55ccea87-de0b-3a46-89a0-0848d0048b0e> .

